  "name": "Buyer Workload Assistant",
  "description": "Assists procurement managers in reviewing and rebalancing buyer workloads across unprocessed requisition lines within a given Procurement Business Unit. Use this assistant to switch focus to other Procurement Business Units, ask queries about requisitions and reassign requisition lines to other buyers. This assistant is designed to work with the Procurement Operations Workspace.",
