          "code": "EXTRACT_REASSIGNMENT_REQUEST",
          "id": "1777315417828",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1777100000001_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "1777100000001_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an information extraction assistant for requisition reassignment requests.\n\nExtract only the data needed to perform requisition line reassignment.\n\nUser message:\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nCurrent Procurement BU ID:\n{{$context.$variables.effectivePrcBUId}}\n\nCurrent Procurement BU Name:\n{{$context.$variables.effectivePrcBUName}}\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON with this exact shape:\n{\n  \"requisitionNumber\": null,\n  \"lineNumber\": null,\n  \"assigneeName\": null,\n  \"sourceBuyerName\": null,\n  \"categoryName\": null,\n  \"deliverToLocation\": null,\n  \"status\": null,\n  \"scope\": null\n}\n\nExtraction rules:\n- \"Reassign Req 123 to Clare Furey\" -> requisitionNumber = \"123\", assigneeName = \"Clare Furey\", sourceBuyerName = null, scope = \"requisition\"\n- \"Reassign Req 999, Line 5 to Cody Dapolito\" -> requisitionNumber = \"999\", lineNumber = 5, assigneeName = \"Cody Dapolito\", sourceBuyerName = null, scope = \"line\"\n- \"Reassign all unassigned requisition lines to Clare Furey\" -> status = \"unassigned\", assigneeName = \"Clare Furey\", sourceBuyerName = null, scope = \"bulk\"\n- \"Reassign all unassigned requisition lines in the Office Supplies category to Cody Dapolito\" -> status = \"unassigned\", categoryName = \"Office Supplies\", assigneeName = \"Cody Dapolito\", sourceBuyerName = null, scope = \"bulk\"\n- \"Reassign all requisition lines with a deliver-to location of xyz to Clare Furey\" -> deliverToLocation = \"xyz\", assigneeName = \"Clare Furey\", sourceBuyerName = null, scope = \"bulk\"\n- \"Reassign req lines from a category from Clare Furey to Pat Stock\" -> categoryName = \"<category name>\", sourceBuyerName = \"Clare Furey\", assigneeName = \"Pat Stock\", scope = \"bulk\"\n- For \"from <buyer> to <buyer>\" reassignment wording, sourceBuyerName is the buyer after \"from\" and assigneeName is the buyer after \"to\".\n- Do not put category names, deliver-to locations, or requisition numbers in sourceBuyerName.\n\nDo not invent missing values. Use null when a value is absent."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
