            {
              "id": "1775114092872_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## DATA\nWorkload preview data: {{$context.$nodes.CALCULATEWORKLOADBEFOREREASSIGNMENT.$output.result}}\nCategoryName: {{$context.$nodes.PARSEORAACTION.$output.result.payload.CategoryName}}\n\n## TASK\nGenerate exactly two widgets in the required output format.\n\n## INSIGHTS TEXT\n**MUST NOT** generate or include any insights text in the output.\n\n### FIRST WIDGET\nGenerate a multirecord widget that shows:\n- Buyer\n- Requisition Lines Before Rebalancing\n- Requisition Lines After Rebalancing\n\nSet the first widget title exactly to:\nPreview of workload rebalance for {CategoryName}\n\nThis widget is a preview of the proposed rebalance.\n\nMust not include any description in this widget.\n\n### SECOND WIDGET\nGenerate a record widget with:\n- oraFormSubmit id: \"reassignment_reason_form\"\n- readOnly: false\n- no title\n- no description\n\nFields:\n1. textarea field\n   - id: \"reassignment_reason\"\n   - label: \"Reason (required, 240-character limit)\"\n   - value: \"Reassigned based on a recommendation from the application\"\n2. system field\n   - id: \"reassignment_payloads\"\n   - value: \"__REASSIGNMENT_PAYLOAD__\"\n3. system field\n   - id: \"buyerIdNameMapping\"\n   - value: \"__BUYER_ID_NAME_MAPPING__\"\n\n## RULES\n- Return only the two widgets.\n- Do not add explanations.\n- Preserve ids exactly as given.\n- Use \"__REASSIGNMENT_PAYLOAD__\" exactly as the system field value."
